# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "This guide demonstrates a minimal working example of the `qiskit-addon-pna` package. We use propagated noise absorption (PNA) to build a noise-mitigating observable. Given a circuit and a Pauli-Lindblad noise model, PNA classically propagates the observable through the inverse noise channel. Measuring the resulting observable on the noisy QPU mitigates the learned gate noise.\n"
msgstr "Panduan ini menunjukkan contoh kerja minimum bagi pakej `qiskit-addon-pna`. Kami menggunakan penyerapan hingar terambat (PNA) untuk membina observable yang mengurangkan hingar. Diberi sebuah litar dan model hingar Pauli-Lindblad, PNA merambatkan observable secara klasik melalui saluran hingar songsang. Mengukur observable yang terhasil pada QPU yang bising mengurangkan hingar gate yang dipelajari.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "To see how to build a realistic workflow and run on quantum hardware with the [directed execution model](/guides/directed-execution-model), including learning the noise model with `NoiseLearnerV3`, check out the [PNA tutorial](/tutorials/propagated-noise-absorption) on the IBM Quantum Platform.\n"
msgstr "Untuk melihat cara membina aliran kerja yang realistik dan menjalankannya pada perkakasan kuantum dengan [model pelaksanaan terarah](/guides/directed-execution-model), termasuk mempelajari model hingar dengan `NoiseLearnerV3`, lihat [tutorial PNA](/tutorials/propagated-noise-absorption) di IBM Quantum Platform.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "1. Prepare the inputs for PNA {#1-prepare-the-inputs-for-pna}"
msgstr "1. Sediakan input untuk PNA {#1-prepare-the-inputs-for-pna}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "PNA takes as input a circuit, noise model, and observable. Here we build a 10-qubit Trotterized transverse-field Ising model on a 1D chain. We generate a random 2-local Pauli-Lindblad noise model for each entangling gate and embed it as a Qiskit Aer `PauliLindbladError` instruction just before that gate. We choose a weight-4 Pauli-Z observable to measure.\n"
msgstr "PNA menerima litar, model hingar, dan observable sebagai input. Di sini kami membina model Ising medan melintang terTrotter 10 qubit pada rantaian 1D. Kami menjana model hingar Pauli-Lindblad 2-setempat rawak bagi setiap gate belitan dan membenamkannya sebagai arahan `PauliLindbladError` Qiskit Aer sebelum gate tersebut. Kami memilih observable Pauli-Z berwajaran 4 untuk diukur.\n"

