# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "2. Generate the noise-mitigating observable {#2-generate-the-noise-mitigating-observable}"
msgstr "2. Jana observable pengurang hingar {#2-generate-the-noise-mitigating-observable}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "[generate_noise_mitigating_observable](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-addon-pna/qiskit-addon-pna#generate_noise_mitigating_observable) propagates each Pauli generator of the inverse noise channel forward to the end of the circuit. The observable is then back-propagated through the inverse noise channel, returning a new observable $\\tilde{O}$. Three key parameters affect the computation cost:\n"
msgstr "[generate_noise_mitigating_observable](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-addon-pna/qiskit-addon-pna#generate_noise_mitigating_observable) merambatkan setiap penjana Pauli bagi saluran hingar songsang ke hadapan hingga akhir litar. Observable kemudian dirambat balik melalui saluran hingar songsang, lalu memulangkan observable baharu $\\tilde{O}$. Tiga parameter utama mempengaruhi kos pengiraan:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "`max_err_terms`: the number of terms kept in each anti-noise generator as it is propagated forward.\n"
msgstr "`max_err_terms`: bilangan sebutan yang dikekalkan dalam setiap penjana anti-hingar semasa ia dirambat ke hadapan.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "`max_obs_terms`: the number of terms kept in $\\tilde{O}$.\n"
msgstr "`max_obs_terms`: bilangan sebutan yang dikekalkan dalam $\\tilde{O}$.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "`atol`: terms with coefficient magnitude below this threshold are dropped.\n"
msgstr "`atol`: sebutan dengan magnitud pekali di bawah ambang ini akan digugurkan.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "For this small, near-Clifford circuit we set the term limits high and use a modest `atol`, so $\\tilde{O}$ stays small and we can measure all of its terms.\n"
msgstr "Untuk litar kecil yang hampir-Clifford ini, kami menetapkan had sebutan yang tinggi dan menggunakan `atol` yang sederhana, supaya $\\tilde{O}$ kekal kecil dan kami boleh mengukur semua sebutannya.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "***Note: This function uses Python `multiprocessing`. When running as a script, call it inside an `if __name__ == \"__main__\":` guard.***\n"
msgstr "***Nota: Fungsi ini menggunakan `multiprocessing` Python. Apabila dijalankan sebagai skrip, panggil ia di dalam pengawal `if __name__ == \"__main__\":`.***\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "3. Mitigate gate errors by measuring the noise-mitigating observable {#3-mitigate-gate-errors-by-measuring-the-noise-mitigating-observable}"
msgstr "3. Kurangkan ralat gate dengan mengukur observable pengurang hingar {#3-mitigate-gate-errors-by-measuring-the-noise-mitigating-observable}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Here we see that the new observable effectively mitigates the gate noise affecting the experiment.\n"
msgstr "Di sini kita melihat bahawa observable baharu secara berkesan mengurangkan hingar gate yang menjejaskan eksperimen.\n"

